, and the soundtrack is synthesised to match. Also on the release page."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/krapcys1-maker/commitverse/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"837bba9153696e9cd9eef657687c66f98e2f648ce3891eb69abcbdc2ed5e59cb","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:10.282Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:10.282Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[]( -ffcf87?style=flat-square) [](.github/workflows/universe.yml) []( [](LICENSE)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/krapcys1-maker/commitverse/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Type your GitHub login on the first card and the autopilot takes you from the whole cluster into your galaxy, your star system and your world.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/krapcys1-maker/commitverse/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"837bba9153696e9cd9eef657687c66f98e2f648ce3891eb69abcbdc2ed5e59cb","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/krapcys1-maker/commitverse/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:10.282Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T11:30:19Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/krapcys1-maker/commitverse/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:10.282Z","hash":"837bba9153696e9cd9eef657687c66f98e2f648ce3891eb69abcbdc2ed5e59cb","originalBytes":14185,"storedBytes":14185,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["world","city","galaxy","every","docs","github","worlds","universe","code","commitverse","star","tools","video","img","blender","git","any","one","repository","film","galaxies","lights","night","out","ring","run","their","whole","building","cluster","elevator","files","history","level","live","main","node","orbital","rockets","stars","bash","express","frame","karpathy","language","npm","open","public","release","repositories","space","zoom","asteroid","browser","card","cities","civilisation","click","fly","galactic","land","line","side","them","through","today","token","watch